</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:5px 0\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);flex:1\">Public profile</span><label class=\"demo-switch\" style=\"width:36px;height:20px\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><span class=\"track\"></span></label></div>\n      </div></div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:stretch\">\n      <div class=\"card-d\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto;min-width:0\">\n        <div class=\"cd-cover\" style=\"height:56px;background:url('/assets/slide-city.png') center/cover\"></div>\n        <div class=\"cd-body\"><div class=\"cd-title\">Wireless Headphones Pro</div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;margin-top:4px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--red);flex:1\">¥ 299</span><span class=\"demo-tag red\">20% off</span></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card-d\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto;min-width:0\">\n        <div class=\"cd-cover\" style=\"height:56px;background:url('/assets/photo-cat.png') center/cover\"></div>\n        <div class=\"cd-body\"><div class=\"cd-title\">Cat-Paw Mechanical Keyboard</div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;margin-top:4px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--red);flex:1\">¥ 199</span><span class=\"demo-tag green\">New</span></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"root\"><div class=\"card-d\" style=\"width:270px\">\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"cover\" style=\"display:block\"><div class=\"cd-cover\" style=\"background:url('/assets/cover-workspace.png') center/cover\"></div></span>\n      <div class=\"cd-body\">\n        <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"title\" style=\"display:block\"><div class=\"cd-title\">AI 图鉴入门</div></span>\n        <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"text\" style=\"display:block\"><div class=\"cd-text\">每个组件一张卡片，3 分钟看懂一个。</div></span>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"actions\" style=\"display:block\"><div class=\"cd-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">详情</button><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">立即学习</button></div></span>\n    </div></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"root\"><div class=\"card-d\" style=\"width:270px\">\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"cover\" style=\"display:block\"><div class=\"cd-cover\" style=\"background:url('/assets/cover-workspace.png') center/cover\"></div></span>\n      <div class=\"cd-body\">\n        <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"title\" style=\"display:block\"><div class=\"cd-title\">Introduction to AI illustrated books</div></span>\n        <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"text\" style=\"display:block\"><div class=\"cd-text\">One card for each component, and you can understand each one in 3 minutes. </div></span>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"actions\" style=\"display:block\"><div class=\"cd-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">Details</button><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">Learn now</button></div></span>\n    </div></span>","parts":[{"key":"root","cn":"卡片","en":"Card","desc":"内容容器，一块 = 一个整体","desc_en":"A self-contained unit of related content"},{"key":"cover","cn":"封面","en":"Cover","desc":"可选，图片放顶部最抓眼","desc_en":"Optional media that helps identify the card’s subject"},{"key":"title","cn":"标题","en":"Title","desc":"卡片里最重的一行字","desc_en":"The card’s primary label"},{"key":"text","cn":"正文","en":"Content","desc":"摘要、说明等补充信息","desc_en":"Supporting context, such as a summary or description"},{"key":"actions","cn":"操作区","en":"Actions","desc":"可选，放和这张卡相关的按钮","desc_en":"Optional actions that apply to this card"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"基础卡片","en":"Basic","demo":"<div class=\"card-d\" style=\"width:180px\">\n      <div class=\"cd-body\"><div class=\"cd-title\">团队知识库</div>\n      <div class=\"cd-text\">收录 47 篇文档，每周更新。</div></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"card-d\" style=\"width:180px\">\n      <div class=\"cd-body\"><div class=\"cd-title\">Team Knowledge Base</div>\n      <div class=\"cd-text\">Contains 47 documents, updated weekly. </div></div></div>","when":"一组文字信息需要作为完整对象浏览时","when_en":"When a group of text needs to be understood as one unit"},{"cn":"带封面","en":"With Cover","demo":"<div class=\"card-d\" style=\"width:180px\">\n      <div class=\"cd-cover\" style=\"background:url('/assets/cover-mountain.png') center/cover\"></div>\n      <div class=\"cd-body\"><div class=\"cd-title\">AI 图鉴入门</div></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"card-d\" style=\"width:180px\">\n      <div class=\"cd-cover\" style=\"background:url('/assets/cover-mountain.png') center/cover\"></div>\n      <div class=\"cd-body\"><div class=\"cd-title\">Introduction to AI illustrated books</div></div></div>","when":"图片是主要识别信息时，将封面置于卡片顶部","when_en":"When the image is the primary identifying information, place the cover at the top of the card"},{"cn":"简洁无边框","en":"Flat","demo":"<div class=\"card-d flat\" style=\"width:180px\">\n      <div class=\"cd-body\"><div class=\"cd-title\">快捷入口</div>\n      <div class=\"cd-text\">弱化边框，融进背景。</div></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"card-d flat\" style=\"width:180px\">\n      <div class=\"cd-body\"><div class=\"cd-title\">Quick entry</div>\n      <div class=\"cd-text\">Weaken the border and blend into the background. </div></div></div>","when":"页面背景已清楚划分内容区域时，可弱化卡片边框","when_en":"When the page background already separates the content area, use a subtler card border"},{"cn":"带操作","en":"With Actions","demo":"<div class=\"card-d\" style=\"width:180px\">\n      <div class=\"cd-body\"><div class=\"cd-title\">官网改版 v2</div></div>\n      <div class=\"cd-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">预览</button><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">编辑</button></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"card-d\" style=\"width:180px\">\n      <div class=\"cd-body\"><div class=\"cd-title\">Website refresh v2</div></div>\n      <div class=\"cd-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">Preview</button><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">Edit</button></div></div>","when":"用户要在卡片上直接预览或编辑","when_en":"Users want to preview or edit directly on the card"}],"use":[{"t":"<b>内容推荐流</b>：文章卡、视频卡、商品卡","m":"card-product"},{"t":"<b>仪表盘</b>上每个指标一块卡，方便扫读","m":"card-metric"},{"t":"把长页面<b>切成几个内容分组</b>，比如设置页","m":"card-group"},{"t":"<b>图片占比大</b>的内容，封面放卡片顶部","m":"card-cover"}],"dont":[{"t":"<b>纯文字长文</b>：使用 {c:typography} 组织排版","m":"card-text","bad":true},{"t":"<b>卡片内再嵌套卡片</b>，双层边框会让容器边界相互竞争","m":"card-nested","bad":true},{"t":"每条只有一行文字：使用 {c:list} 更紧凑","m":"list-menu"},{"t":"整页只有<b>一块独立内容</b>，通常不需要再套卡片边界","m":"card-single","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"模板市场要以网格展示模板，每项都有封面、名称、作者和价格，点击后进入模板详情页。怎样组织这些内容？","options":[{"id":"item-cards","label":"每个模板做成一张信息边界清楚的卡片","feedback":"每个模板都是可独立浏览和进入详情的对象，卡片能把它的关键信息组合在一起。","correct":true},{"id":"single-panel","label":"把所有模板放进一张覆盖整页的大卡片","feedback":"一张大容器无法表达每个模板的独立边界，也会让点击目标和信息归属变模糊。","correct":false},{"id":"dense-table","label":"使用只有文字列的紧凑数据表格","feedback":"数据表适合密集比较字段，但题目要求突出封面并以视觉方式浏览模板。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"A template marketplace shows a grid where each item has a cover, name, author, price, and its own detail page. How should it be organized?","options":[{"id":"item-cards","label":"Give each template its own card with a clear information boundary","feedback":"Each template is an independent browsable object, so a card can group its key information and destination.","correct":true},{"id":"single-panel","label":"Put every template inside one large card covering the page","feedback":"One large container hides item boundaries and makes click targets and information ownership unclear.","correct":false},{"id":"dense-table","label":"Use a compact text-only data table for all templates","feedback":"A table suits dense field comparison, but the task calls for visual browsing led by template covers.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"把模板市场的每个模板做成独立卡片，展示封面、名称、作者和价格，点击主区域进入对应详情。请避免嵌套卡片，并验证卡片内按钮不会误触详情跳转。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Make each marketplace template an independent card with cover, name, author, and price, with the main area opening its detail page. Avoid nested cards and verify inner buttons do not trigger navigation."}},"demoDetail":"<div class=\"card-d\">\n    <div class=\"cd-cover\" style=\"background:url('/assets/cover-workspace.png') center/cover\"></div>\n    <div class=\"cd-body\">\n      <div class=\"cd-title\">AI 图鉴：零基础组件入门</div>\n      <div class=\"cd-text\">每个组件一张卡片，3 分钟看懂一个。</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cd-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">详情</button><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">立即学习</button></div>\n  </div>","references":[{"title":"卡片：UI 组件的定义","source":"NN/g","url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/cards-component/","title_en":"Cards: UI-Component Definition"},{"title":"Cards 卡片","source":"Material Design","url":"https://m3.material.io/components/cards/overview","title_en":"Cards"}],"scenes":["内容推荐流","仪表盘指标卡","设置页分组","商品展示"],"en":{"demoDetail":"<div class=\"card-d\">\n    <div class=\"cd-cover\" style=\"background:url('/assets/cover-workspace.png') center/cover\"></div>\n    <div class=\"cd-body\">\n      <div class=\"cd-title\">VibeHub Component Guide for Beginners</div>\n      <div class=\"cd-text\">Learn one interface component at a time in about three minutes. </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cd-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">View details</button><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">Start learning</button></div>\n  </div>","use":[{"t":"Browse products or articles","m":"card-product"},{"t":"Summarize projects or files","m":"card-metric"},{"t":"Group an item's image and metadata","m":"card-group"},{"t":"Build a responsive content grid","m":"card-cover"}],"dont":[{"t":"Wrap every small piece of content in another card","m":"card-text","bad":true},{"t":"Make the whole card clickable when it contains conflicting controls","m":"card-nested","bad":true},{"t":"Mix unrelated information in one block","m":"list-menu"